  "question": {
    "text": "A bullet is fired into a fixed target looses one third of its velocity after travelling <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. It penetrates further <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> before coming to rest. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "t69Sf",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>32</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "9KQVW",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "XFFjA",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tby4O",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When the bullet just enters the target, its equation of motion is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>S</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation (1) implies that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>…</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>When the bullet stops inside the target, its equation of motion can be written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation (3) implies that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Dividing equation (2) by equation (4), we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
